        "text": "HISTORY AND PHYSICAL\nDate of service: 07/20/2025\nEncounter: annual wellness / establish care\nHPI: 85-year-old female presenting to establish primary care. No acute complaints. Reports numbness and tingling of the left hand of several months' duration, referred to Hand Surgery for evaluation.\nPMH: Atrial fibrillation.\nEXAM: Well-appearing, no acute distress. Heart regular. Lungs clear. Abdomen benign.\nPLAN: Routine health maintenance. Follow up with specialist as scheduled."
